# Screen corpus. Syntax: see ../FORMAT.md ("Corpus files"). Each case is written through a
# headless xterm.js 6.0.0 terminal (Unicode 11 active) and dumped (attributes, modes, responses,
# title, links). `size` defaults to 80 24.
#
# `random` makes goldens/screen/random.golden (srand_0001 ...): grammar-biased streams of whole
# registered sequences, see FORMAT.md. No case sends RIS and OSC 8 links together: lune-vt frees a
# reset buffer's links (decision Q9), upstream leaks them, so url ids after a reset differ by design.
random 200 seed 0x5c4ee7

case sgr_attributes
size 40 6
input "\e[1mbold\e[0m \e[2mdim\e[0m \e[3mitalic\e[0m \e[4munder\e[0m \e[5mblink\e[0m \e[7minverse\e[0m\r\n\e[8minvis\e[0m \e[9mstrike\e[0m \e[53moverline\e[0m \e[1;3;4;9mall\e[0m end"

